# Java Practice

This directory contains my Java practice programs while learning Core Java. The code is organized topic-wise to strengthen my understanding of Java fundamentals, object-oriented programming, problem-solving, and programming best practices.

## Topics Covered
- Variables & Data Types
- Operators
- Control Statements
- Methods
- Arrays
- Strings
- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- Inheritance
- Polymorphism
- Abstraction
- Interfaces
- Exception Handling
- Collections
- File Handling
- JDBC (Later)

This directory is updated regularly as I continue learning and practicing Java.
